@startuml Device Control
title Device Control

actor User
participant "Mobile App" as App
participant "API Backend" as API
participant "MQTT Broker" as MQTT
participant "ESP Device" as ESP
participant "Database" as DB

== Viewing Devices ==
User -> App: View garden dashboard
App -> API: GET /api/devices/garden/{garden_id}
API -> DB: Fetch devices for garden's ESPs
DB -> API: Return device list
API -> App: Device data with status
App -> User: Display device list

== Controlling All Devices in Garden ==
User -> App: Tap "Turn On All" for actuator type
App -> API: POST /api/devices/garden/{garden_id}/{actuator}/on
API -> DB: Get all ESPs in garden
DB -> API: ESP list
API -> MQTT: Publish control command to all ESPs
MQTT -> ESP: Forward command
ESP -> ESP: Activate actuator
API -> App: Success status
App -> User: Update device status to active

== Controlling Specific ESP Device ==
User -> App: Tap control for specific ESP
App -> API: POST /api/devices/esp/{esp_id}/{actuator}/{action}
API -> DB: Get ESP details
DB -> API: ESP data
API -> MQTT: Publish control command to ESP
MQTT -> ESP: Forward command
ESP -> ESP: Execute action on actuator
API -> App: Success status
App -> User: Update device status

@enduml
